'''Kay''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Lagoon Hut}}. She gives the {{Item|Very Scientific Paper}}, which given be given to {{NPCSprite|Dr. Edwin}}, as well as lets the player sell {{Item|Lil' Pad}}s or be launched to the shore.

